<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In all the world around me</l><l>I see His loving care,</l><l>And though my heart grows weary,</l><l>I never will despair;</l><l>I know that He is leading,</l><l>Through all the stormy blast;</l><l>The day of His appearing</l><l>Will come at last.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Rejoice, rejoice, O Christian,</l><l>Lift up your voice and sing</l><l>Eternal hallelujahs</l><l>To Jesus Christ the King!</l><l>The Hope of all who seek Him,</l><l>The Help of all who find,</l><l>None other is so loving,</l><l>So good and kind.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
